sequenceDiagram
    title Result Persistence - Store Backend Semantics
    autonumber

    participant Flusher as ResultFlushCoordinator
    participant Store as ResultStore
    participant Csv as CsvResultStore
    participant Sql as SqlResultStore

    Flusher->>Store: save_batch(ResultBatch)
    alt CsvResultStore
        Store->>Csv: append unique event and metric rows by event_id / metric_id
        Store->>Csv: append trade, cycle, and task snapshots
        Note over Csv: Readers select the latest snapshot for each logical key
    else SqlResultStore
        Store->>Sql: begin one transaction for the batch
        loop each record
            Sql->>Sql: delete existing row by primary key
            Sql->>Sql: insert replacement row
        end
        Sql-->>Store: commit transaction
    else custom ResultStore
        Store->>Store: persist ResultBatch using store-defined semantics
    end
